These five visualizations provide immediate, intuitive validation of the key conclusions from Stage 1. They confirm that Display campaigns, Enhanced CPC bidding, and certain industries (Real Estate, Electronics, Travel & Hospitality) are the primary risk areas, and that health‑score trends over time require seasonal attention. The cost‑vs‑ROAS scatter plot underscores the need for granular, campaign‑level intervention to reallocate budgets and improve underlying performance drivers.
