3. **POiVt97420 (Joint‑venture)** – Highest supply‑interruption score among JV drugs (abnormal price, high quarantine, discrepancy) coupled with serious quality‑risk. **Review quarantine reasons and check for potential counterfeit or storage‑condition breaches**.
