But before diving deeper, we should compute ROAS (conversions_value / spend) for ad groups to assess profitability. Also compute cost per click (CPC) = spend / clicks.

Let's write another Python script to compute these financial metrics and compare problematic vs high-CTR good groups. Also examine ad_type distribution.

