# Email Campaign Analysis: Send Timing and Subject Effects

## Overview
Analysis of 184 email campaigns after outlier removal.

## Key Metrics Distribution
### Open Rate Distribution
|       |   email_open_rate |
|:------|------------------:|
| count |       184         |
| mean  |         0.312936  |
| std   |         0.0389279 |
| min   |         0.238     |
| 25%   |         0.294     |
| 50%   |         0.315     |
| 75%   |         0.327     |
| max   |         0.402     |
### Click-to-Open Rate Distribution
|       |   email_click_to_open_rate |
|:------|---------------------------:|
| count |                184         |
| mean  |                  0.13691   |
| std   |                  0.0131654 |
| min   |                  0.1082    |
| 25%   |                  0.1303    |
| 50%   |                  0.1388    |
| 75%   |                  0.146725  |
| max   |                  0.1607    |
## Subject Category Performance (Weighted by Received Emails)
| subject_category   |   open_rate_weighted |   click_rate_weighted |   order_rate_weighted |   gmv_per_opened |
|:-------------------|---------------------:|----------------------:|----------------------:|-----------------:|
| discount           |             0.341557 |             0.0509709 |            0.00604403 |          2.92798 |
| new                |             0.325491 |             0.0459285 |            0.00456726 |          2.82742 |
| storytelling       |             0.275963 |             0.0339502 |            0.00280498 |          1.6826  |
## Send Time Window Performance
### Weekday vs Weekend
