| weekend    |             0.319083 |             0.0447629 |            0.00467533 |          2.62087 |
### Time of Day
| time_period   |   open_rate_weighted |   click_rate_weighted |   order_rate_weighted |   gmv_per_opened |
|:--------------|---------------------:|----------------------:|----------------------:|-----------------:|
