The task also mentions building a decay risk assessment model. Let's create a model using multiple metrics to predict decay risk (defined as combination of CAC increase and ratio decrease). We'll define a binary risk flag based on whether both metrics are moving in negative direction (CAC growth > 10% and ratio decline < -10%) for recent periods or trends.

